    "name": "Peter's Journey",
    "steam_appid": 2911800,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911800/extras/e6737dae649ff0dae79945ce71857d42.avif?t=1720687555\" width=616 height=198 /></span><br><br>Peter is a young and very ambitious man. One day , he decided that he couldn\u2019t wait any longer  and had to hit the road because he had a dream!<br><br>In this text-based RPG you will go on a journey and see the world through the Peter \u2019s eyes. You will meet other heroes, each of whom can influence the course of history. Will you rescue the beautiful stranger? Help a kind old lady? Fulfill a fellow traveler's request? It depends only on you whether Peter can overcome the challenges  and fulfill his dream.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Study  the stories of heroes . Explore the heroes\u2019 stories.<br></li><li>Defeat bandits.<br></li><li>Upgrade your characteristics.</li></ul><br>And don\u2019t forget to take a diary: it will help you make the right choice.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Team</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911800/extras/dbe83ea488d40d831c6e1e54741c517f.avif?t=1720687555\" width=616 height=104 /></span><br>We are a small development studio specializing in VR and AR projects.<br>&quot;Peter\u2019s Journey&quot; is our debut project in Steam and a new experience in creating 2D-games. <br>The prototype of the game was developed by a studio employe while completing the task in the final of the second season of the All-Russian competition \u201cStart the Game\u201d in the competence of Unity Developer. <br><br>The project is completely non-commercial, it is created for the purpose of gaining experience, knowledge and new emotions on pure enthusiasm.<br>We will be very glad to receive any feedback, suggestions, criticism and comments!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911800/extras/e6737dae649ff0dae79945ce71857d42.avif?t=1720687555\" width=616 height=198 /></span><br><br>Peter is a young and very ambitious man. One day , he decided that he couldn\u2019t wait any longer  and had to hit the road because he had a dream!<br><br>In this text-based RPG you will go on a journey and see the world through the Peter \u2019s eyes. You will meet other heroes, each of whom can influence the course of history. Will you rescue the beautiful stranger? Help a kind old lady? Fulfill a fellow traveler's request? It depends only on you whether Peter can overcome the challenges  and fulfill his dream.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Study  the stories of heroes . Explore the heroes\u2019 stories.<br></li><li>Defeat bandits.<br></li><li>Upgrade your characteristics.</li></ul><br>And don\u2019t forget to take a diary: it will help you make the right choice.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Team</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911800/extras/dbe83ea488d40d831c6e1e54741c517f.avif?t=1720687555\" width=616 height=104 /></span><br>We are a small development studio specializing in VR and AR projects.<br>&quot;Peter\u2019s Journey&quot; is our debut project in Steam and a new experience in creating 2D-games. <br>The prototype of the game was developed by a studio employe while completing the task in the final of the second season of the All-Russian competition \u201cStart the Game\u201d in the competence of Unity Developer. <br><br>The project is completely non-commercial, it is created for the purpose of gaining experience, knowledge and new emotions on pure enthusiasm.<br>We will be very glad to receive any feedback, suggestions, criticism and comments!",
    "short_description": "Embark on a journey of this text anime quest with RPG elements! Walk through beautiful locations, overcome challenges and make Peter\u2019s dreams come true. Every step you take matters. And don\u2019t forget to take the diary - you\u2019ll need it!",
